<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 18	Dec 17	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.560     244.500     237.040    3.59 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.910     304.760     303.640    0.42 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.360     158.185     165.490   -4.31 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.840	46.860	48.410   -3.24 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  411.500     407.460     366.280   12.35 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.100     140.995     147.886   -4.59 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.076	16.051	14.975    7.35 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.380     214.920     230.135   -5.98 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.883	 1.880	 1.939   -2.89 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.573	 1.568	 1.575   -0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.200     184.750     206.030  -12.54 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
